{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2021-12-20 12:31:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN INCENTIVE ADVANCES SUSTAINABILITY WHILE TACKLING SUPPLY-CHAIN CONGESTION AND SUPPORTING GROWTH', 'text': "ATLANTA, DEC. 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE:NSC) HAS ROLLED OUT A PILOT INCENTIVE PROGRAM FOR INTERMODAL SHIPPING PARTNERS THAT AIMS TO DRIVE MARKET EFFICIENCIES, GROW CAPACITY AT ITS INTERNATIONAL INTERMODAL TERMINALS, AND ADVANCE KEY SUSTAINABILITY GOALS. DUAL MISSION REWARD PROGRAM PILOT AIMS FOR INTERMODAL MARKETPLACE EFFICIENCIES THE DUAL MISSION REWARD PROGRAM IS BEING TESTED AT LANDERS INTERMODAL FACILITY IN CHICAGO, THE COMPANY'S LARGEST TERMINAL HANDLING INTERNATIONAL FREIGHT, AND AT THE RAILROAD'S KANSAS CITY INTERMODAL FACILITY."}